WEBVTT

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:31.728
the higher you go up the academic ladder,

00:15:31.752 --> 00:15:34.141
the lonelier and lonelier it becomes,

00:15:34.165 --> 00:15:37.869
because you're one of the few people
who are from that background.

00:15:38.440 --> 00:15:41.606
AG: Luz grew up in Puerto Rico
with a huge family around.

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:43.486
She likes going places in groups

00:15:43.510 --> 00:15:45.483
and she loves salsa dancing.

00:15:45.507 --> 00:15:48.056
LC: I love salsa music.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.046
My favorite thing to do
outside of work is salsa.

00:15:51.070 --> 00:15:56.856
I try to engage with, you know,
try to motivate people in my office.

00:15:56.880 --> 00:16:00.546
"Oh, there's a new restaurant nearby,
you want to come check it out?"